====Usage notes====
The term {{term/t|sh|sc=Cyrl|Ср̏бин}} denotes an ethnic Serb, while the term {{term/t|sh|sc=Cyrl|Србија́нац}} denotes either a Serb from [[Central Serbia]] (Serbia excluding Vojvodina) or a a citizen of [[Serbia]] regardless of his ethnicity. The word has almost no usage in spoken common speech, and is primarily used in literary language, such as within the phrase {{term||srbijanski preds(j)ednik|the president of Serbia}}. The terms is sometimes considered derogatory by Serbs, and the terms {{term/t|sh|sc=Cyrl|Ср̏бин}} and {{term/t|sh|sc=Cyrl|Ср̏пкиња}} are should be used instead.

